d 'STAGGEREDGMM': module to perform Generalised Method of Moments Estimation of Treatment Effects under Staggered Adoption
d
d    staggeredgmm estimates cohort-by-time average treatment
d effects (CATTs) under staggered treatment adoption by the
d generalized	 method of moments, following Arora and Bijani
d (2026). Each CATT is identified by every clean 2x2
d difference-in-differences    comparison available for it: against
d never-treated units and against cohorts that are not yet treated.
d The clean comparisons are    stacked into an over-identified
d moment system and combined by iterated optimal GMM, with the
d weight built from a model of the    serial correlation of the
d errors. 
d
d KW: GMM
d KW: staggered adoption
d KW: cohort ATT
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261119
d
d Author:  Parush Arora,   Ashoka University
d Support: email parush.arora@@ashoka.edu.in
d
d Author:  Rishabh Bijani,   Ashoka University
d Support: email rishabhbijani@@gmail.com
d
